            <ArticleTitle>[Strain on the intervertebral disk and vertebrae in stress].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>63-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The experimental data about the strain of intervertebral discs and vertebral bodies under physiologic loads are described; the relation between tissue strain, mechanically induced damage and clinical symptoms in the region of the lumbar spine is discussed. With reference to a paper by Kirkaldy-Willis and Farfan on &quot;Instability of the Spine&quot; a new representation of the interrelation between mechanical factors, pathologic changes and psychic influences in the development of low back pain is given.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
